TestNG
- Settings Plugins - Add TestNG Plugin
- Settings Plugins - Add Create TestNG XML Plugin
- Run - Edit configurations for testng.xml file and add listeners - EmailableReporter and FailedReporter
- Annotations - @Test < @Before/AfterMethod < @Before/AfterClass < @Before/AfterTest < @Before/AfterSuite
- Priority - (priority = 1) - default 0
- Enabling/Disabling - (enabled = false) - default true
- Always Run - (alwaysRun = true) - default false
- Dependency - (dependsOnMethods = {"methodName1", "methodName2"})
- Groups - (groups = {"sanity", "regression"})
- Parameters - @Parameters({"browser", "url"})
- Data Provider method - @DataProvider(name = "LoginDataProvider"), @Test(dataProvider = "LoginDataProvider")
- Data Provider method - @DataProvider(name = "LoginDataProvider"), @Test(dataProvider = "LoginDataProvider", dataProviderClass = CustomDataProvider.class)
- Parallel Tests - <suite name="Parallel Suite" parallel = "tests/classes/methods/instances" thread-count="3">
- Listeners - ITestListener - @Listeners(CustomListener.class) above test class or